WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Focus timer. Start a 15, 25 or 50-minute focus session on a task, with breaks.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: pomodoro; deep work.

3
00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:11.990
(Note: Time is fast-forwarded in this video so a whole session fits in a few seconds.) Pick a focus length…

4
00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.030
…and start. A floating timer follows you around Flow.

5
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.920
Pause when you're interrupted…

6
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.650
…and resume.

7
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:24.330
At the end, take a five-minute break — or log the time.

8
00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:30.330
No notification at the end: Allow notifications for Flow in your browser.

9
00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:34.830
15, 25 or 50 minutes
